note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note c2glob.om: checker2 in seeded Omega, part 1 of the unit (constants and tables).
note Port of src/checker2/c2_ir.c (c2_decode) and src/checker2/c2_check.c (c2_check_unit) plus the
note `check` command of src/checker2/checker2_main.c. The C stays as the differential oracle
note (tests/checker2/om_diff.sh). checker2 is independent of the compiler's decoder by design, so this
note unit shares no code with seed/oscgpu/oscir.om. Build order: tests/checker2/om_build.sh.
note Names: globals and constants start with c, functions with c2_.
om2

